    "detailed_description": "While investigating strange occurrences on a now-desolate planet, you fall through a portal that takes you to a strange place.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to &quot;The Disparate&quot;,</h2>a space outside of our Universe, where the physical laws don't quite seem to work right. A space where direction is meaningless.<br><br>As you try to escape this maze-like dimension, use the Dimenshift Device to &quot;shift&quot; through walls and evade the &quot;Machines&quot;. Explore a strange place that doesn't quite make sense. Discover secrets, and maybe uncover the mysterious origins of this place.<br><br>What lies deeper in the Disparate?<br><br>Is it danger? Power? Fiction? Reality?<br><br>\u2026Hope?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A maze of levels requiring exploration to successfully navigate. Enjoy going in circles and feeling lost and confused!<br></li><li> Unique, challenging, and puzzling platforming mechanics. Shift through walls, re-orient yourself, and pay close attention...<br></li><li> Lots of secrets, including logs left by a scientist working on a mysterious project. Might these reveal the origins of this strange place?<br></li><li> 3D auto-runner bonus levels. Can you reach the end of each of them?<br></li><li> Strange and original music emanating from this dimension, adding to the mysterious atmosphere...</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "While investigating strange occurrences on a now-desolate planet, you fall through a portal that takes you to a strange place.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to &quot;The Disparate&quot;,</h2>a space outside of our Universe, where the physical laws don't quite seem to work right. A space where direction is meaningless.<br><br>As you try to escape this maze-like dimension, use the Dimenshift Device to &quot;shift&quot; through walls and evade the &quot;Machines&quot;. Explore a strange place that doesn't quite make sense. Discover secrets, and maybe uncover the mysterious origins of this place.<br><br>What lies deeper in the Disparate?<br><br>Is it danger? Power? Fiction? Reality?<br><br>\u2026Hope?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A maze of levels requiring exploration to successfully navigate. Enjoy going in circles and feeling lost and confused!<br></li><li> Unique, challenging, and puzzling platforming mechanics. Shift through walls, re-orient yourself, and pay close attention...<br></li><li> Lots of secrets, including logs left by a scientist working on a mysterious project. Might these reveal the origins of this strange place?<br></li><li> 3D auto-runner bonus levels. Can you reach the end of each of them?<br></li><li> Strange and original music emanating from this dimension, adding to the mysterious atmosphere...</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A minimalist sci-fi 2D platformer where you shift through walls and machines. Explore and find secrets in a strange, maze-like dimension, where the laws of physics don't seem to make sense.",
